{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeWedderburn3","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeWedderburn3","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDim3Dim"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.wedderburn3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.wedderburn3","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeWedderburn3.lean#L93-L98","doc":"**The Wedderburn isomorphism** `H_3(q) ≅ ℝ × ℝ × M₂(ℝ)** (`q ≠ 0`) — the\nArtin–Wedderburn decomposition of the semisimple Iwahori–Hecke algebra at `n = 3`,\nmatching `1² + 1² + 2² = 6 = 3!`.  R2-inst at `n = 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.rho_bijective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.rho_bijective","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeWedderburn3.lean#L81-L91","doc":"**`ρ` is bijective** (`q ≠ 0`): injective + equal finrank (`6 = 6`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.rho_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.rho_injective","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeWedderburn3.lean#L55-L79","doc":"**`ρ` is injective** (`q ≠ 0`): the three irreps jointly separate points, via the\nsix-word basis and the component core `sixCoeffs_zero`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.finrank_rhs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.finrank_rhs","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeWedderburn3.lean#L49-L53","doc":"`finrank_ℝ (ℝ × ℝ × M₂(ℝ)) = 6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.rho_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.rho_apply","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeWedderburn3.lean#L45-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.rho","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.rho","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeWedderburn3.lean#L39-L43","doc":"The **product representation** `ρ = (rhoTriv, rhoSign, seminormalRep21)` of\n`H_3(q)` into `ℝ × ℝ × M₂(ℝ)` (`q ≠ 0`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}